# Vitis build trees: ~100 MB per DUT, fully regenerated by run.tcl.
# A glob, not a list: the list silently missed user_proj/ when a tenth DUT was added, and ~100 MB
# of build artifacts went into a commit.
*_proj/
logs/
# results/ is NOT ignored -- the C-sim and co-sim outputs are the evidence this package exists
# to produce, and they are small text files.
